","interpretation_note":"完整張暢本傳及對話語境判讀；同字不跨篇自動合人，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-059-zhangchang:p018","chapter_id":"c-songshu-059-zhangchang"},{"id":"c-songshu-059-zhangchang:p018:m0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"休若","kind":"person","person_id":"ocd_3cp_0g9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整張暢本傳及對話語境判讀；同字不跨篇自動合人，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-059-zhangchang:p018","chapter_id":"c-songshu-059-zhangchang"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-song052-xiechun-m1-160","person_id":"ocd_3cp_0g9","title":"巴陵王","kind":"noble_rank","mode":"attestation","attestations":[{"id":"th-song052-xiechun-m1-160:a","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiechun:p001:m0163","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null,"paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiechun:p001","surface":"巴陵王","start":160,"end":163}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-xiechun-ws2190655","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiechun","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiechun:p001","quote":"景仁弟純字景懋，初為劉毅豫州別駕。毅鎮江陵，以為衞軍長史、南平相。王鎮惡率軍襲毅，已至城下，時毅疾病，佐吏皆入參承。純參承畢，已出，聞兵至，馳還入府。左右引車欲還外解，純叱之曰：「我人吏也，逃欲何之！」乃入。及毅兵敗眾散，時已暗夜，司馬毛脩之謂純曰：「君但隨僕。」純不從，扶兩人出，火光中為人所殺。純孫沈，太宗泰始初，為巴陵王休若衞軍錄事參軍、山陰令，坐事誅。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiechun:p001:m0163"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按本見證原職名及其所屬人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"person_references":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-042-wangyan:p002:r0019","surface":"巴陵王","start":19,"end":22,"person_id":"ocd_3cp_0g9","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-042-wangyan:p002","quote":"晏，宋大明末起家臨賀王國常侍，員外郎，巴陵王征北板參軍，安成王撫軍板刑獄，隨府轉車騎。","note":"按時序、詔書發言者或對照本傳。","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-042-wangyan","book_id":"b-nanqishu-042","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-042-wangyan-ws1507997"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen:p006:r0152","surface":"巴陵","start":152,"end":154,"person_id":"ocd_3cp_0g9","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen:p006","quote":"景文屢辭內授，上手詔譬之曰：「尚書左僕射，卿已經此任，東宮詹事用人雖美，職次政可比中書令耳。庶姓作揚州，徐幹木、王休元、殷鐵並處之不辭，卿清令才望，何愧休元，毗贊中興，豈謝幹木，綢繆相與，何後殷鐵邪？司徒以宰相不應帶神州，遠遵先旨，京口鄉基義重，密邇畿內，又不得不用驃騎。陝西任要，由來用宗室，驃騎既去，巴陵理應居之，中流雖曰閑地，控帶三江，通接荊、郢，經塗之要，由來有重鎮。如此，則揚州自成闕刺史。卿若有辭，便不知誰應處之。此選大備與公卿疇懷，非聊爾也。」固辭詹事、領選，徙為中書令，常侍、僕射、揚州如故。又進中書監，領太子太傅，常侍、揚州如故。景文固辭太傅，上遣新除尚書右僕射褚彥回宣旨，不得已乃受拜。","note":"按說話人、受話人及詔內上下文。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangyu-jingwen-ws2478204"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-xiechun:p001:r0160","surface":"巴陵王","start":160,"end":163,"person_id":"ocd_3cp_0g9","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiechun:p001","quote":"景仁弟純字景懋，初為劉毅豫州別駕。毅鎮江陵，以為衞軍長史、南平相。王鎮惡率軍襲毅，已至城下，時毅疾病，佐吏皆入參承。純參承畢，已出，聞兵至，馳還入府。左右引車欲還外解，純叱之曰：「我人吏也，逃欲何之！」乃入。及毅兵敗眾散，時已暗夜，司馬毛脩之謂純曰：「君但隨僕。」純不從，扶兩人出，火光中為人所殺。純孫沈，太宗泰始初，為巴陵王休若衞軍錄事參軍、山陰令，坐事誅。","note":"本句即以名休若承其爵。","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiechun","book_id":"b-songshu-052","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-052-xiechun-ws2190655"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p006","text":"巴陵王休若爲北徐州，未親政事，以岱爲冠軍諮議參軍，領彭城太守，行府、州、國事。後臨海王爲征虜廣州，豫章王爲車騎揚州，晉安王爲征虜南兖州，岱歷爲三府諮議、三王行事，與典籤主帥共事，事舉而情得。或謂岱曰：「主王旣幼，執事多門，而每能緝和公私，云何致此？」岱曰：「古人言一心可以事百君。我爲政端平，待物以禮，悔吝之事，無由而及。明闇短長，更是才用之多少耳。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":40,"last_line":40,"raw_start":1692,"raw_end":1868,"raw_character_offsets":[1692,1693,1694,1695,1696,1697,1698,1699,1700,1701,1702,1703,1704,1705,1706,1707,1708,1709,1710,1711,1712,1713,1714,1715,1716,1717,1718,1719,1720,1721,1722,1723,1724,1725,1726,1727,1728,1729,1730,1731,1732,1733,1734,1735,1736,1737,1738,1739,1740,1741,1742,1743,1744,1745,1746,1747,1748,1749,1750,1751,1752,1753,1754,1755,1756,1757,1758,1759,1760,1761,1762,1763,1764,1765,1766,1767,1768,1769,1770,1771,1772,1773,1774,1775,1776,1777,1778,1779,1780,1781,1782,1783,1784,1785,1786,1787,1788,1789,1790,1791,1792,1793,1794,1795,1796,1797,1798,1799,1800,1801,1802,1803,1804,1805,1806,1807,1808,1809,1810,1811,1812,1813,1814,1815,1816,1817,1818,1819,1820,1821,1822,1823,1824,1825,1826,1827,1828,1829,1830,1831,1832,1833,1834,1835,1836,1837,1838,1839,1840,1841,1842,1843,1844,1845,1846,1847,1848,1849,1850,1851,1852,1853,1854,1855,1856,1857,1858,1859,1860,1861,1862,1863,1864,1865,1866,1867],"revision_id":1513918},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p006:m0000","start":0,"end":5,"surface":"巴陵王休若","kind":"person","person_id":"ocd_3cp_0g9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p006:m0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"岱","kind":"person","person_id":"d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p006:m0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"岱","kind":"person","person_id":"d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p006:m0097","start":97,"end":98,"surface":"岱","kind":"person","person_id":"d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p006:m0125","start":125,"end":126,"surface":"岱","kind":"person","person_id":"d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family","book_id":"b-nanqishu-032","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family-ws1513918"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-042-wangyan:p002","text":"晏，宋大明末起家臨賀王國常侍，員外郎，巴陵王征北板參軍，安成王撫軍板刑獄，隨府轉車騎。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-042-wangyan:p002:m0000","surface":"晏","start":0,"end":1,"person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"re